# Pampas & Selene: play.keys (Space through the title, then RIGHT 41-43 s, LEFT 43.5-45.5 s)
# with SNAPs of the right-facing (42.5 s) and left-facing (45 s) character.
14s   SPACE 5 every 100 until 40s
41s   RIGHT 100
43.5s LEFT  100
46s   UP    40
47s   DOWN  40
48.5s SPACE 5 every 30 until 54s
50s   RIGHT 150
54s   LEFT  100
42.5s SNAP
45s   SNAP
